sentences.text:
This Court has considered the following facts while exercising discretion in favour of the applicant :-
(i) the applicant is in jail since 04.02.2023;
(ii) the investigation is over and the charge-sheet is filed;
(iii) prima facie, this seems to be a case of relationship between the accused person and victim girl;
(iv) there is no past antecedent as stated by learned advocate Mr. Mavadhiya for the applicant;

Hence, present application is allowed and the applicant is ordered to be released on regular bail in connection with the FIR being C.R.No.11186006230037 of 2023 registered with NEUTRAL CITATION R/CR.MA/10264/2023 ORDER DATED: 18/08/2023 undefined Sutrapada Police Station, District:- Gir Somnath on executing personal bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten thousand only) with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the learned Trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
[a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
[b] not act in a manner injuries to the interest of the prosecution;
[c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
[d] not leave Gujarat without prior permission of the Sessions Judge concerned;
Anupambhai Asharam Sharma vs State Of Gujarat on 18 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/86744773/
2 [e] furnish latest address of residence to the Investigating Officer and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior permission of the trial Court;

